(515281, 50945, 13440, '<td valign="top">I couldn\''t see any Vehicles in this photo...</td>', 'I couldn\''t see any Vehicles in this photo...', '2003-12-17 05:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(515284, 51080, 12654, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot -  everything is a sillhouette- crazy lines going here and there,  the people suspended vertically and - you even got the moon in the center of it all. Very nice shot indeed. Great timing and great angle. Everything seems in place.</td>', 'This is a very nice shot -  everything is a sillhouette- crazy lines going here and there,  the people suspended vertically and - you even got the moon in the center of it all. Very nice shot indeed. Great timing and great angle. Everything seems in place.', '2003-12-17 05:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(515285, 51139, 12654, '<td valign="top">What in the world is that? Its got 2 wheels only - whats holding it in place?Or is it a stationary object? But this  challenge is about vehicles so...........<br/>Hmmm.. .. interesting. If it is attachd to something else - then this person is going backwards - but ........ - im baffled - please explain. <br/>My word I''ve nevr seen something like that before :)</td>', 'What in the world is that? Its got 2 wheels only - whats holding it in place?Or is it a stationary object? But this  challenge is about vehicles so...........Hmmm.. .. interesting. If it is attachd to something else - then this person is going backwards - but ........ - im baffled - please explain. My word I''ve nevr seen something like that before :)', '2003-12-17 05:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(515286, 50471, 12654, '<td valign="top">Wow!</td>', 'Wow!', '2003-12-17 05:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(515309, 50765, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like this very much.</td>', 'I like this very much.', '2003-12-17 06:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(515314, 50774, 10763, '<td valign="top">Sick Pic!!</td>', 'Sick Pic!!', '2003-12-17 06:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(515317, 51177, 12654, '<td valign="top">Good timing.</td>', 'Good timing.', '2003-12-17 06:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(515319, 50622, 14603, '<td valign="top">Like the perspective..would have been perfect with another tractor framed in the little triangular space between the wheels. Good work</td>', 'Like the perspective..would have been perfect with another tractor framed in the little triangular space between the wheels. Good work', '2003-12-17 06:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(515320, 51198, 14401, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous image!  Thanks for sharing!</td>', 'This is a gorgeous image!  Thanks for sharing!', '2003-12-17 06:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(515321, 51201, 14401, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I just don''t see it.</td>', 'Sorry, I just don''t see it.', '2003-12-17 06:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(515324, 51132, 14401, '<td valign="top">Cute!  In theme and seasonally appropriate.</td>', 'Cute!  In theme and seasonally appropriate.', '2003-12-17 06:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(515328, 51127, 14401, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.</td>', 'Interesting composition.', '2003-12-17 07:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(515330, 50663, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice picture but I find the bonnet on the lady on the right blown out.  Also the edges of the white clothing seem oversharpened.  Nice crop and good subject matter.</td>', 'Nice picture but I find the bonnet on the lady on the right blown out.  Also the edges of the white clothing seem oversharpened.  Nice crop and good subject matter.', '2003-12-17 07:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(515337, 50831, 11738, '<td valign="top">The title came up before the image and I was "wtf?", then it popped up and ROFL.  Excellent choice of title to go with image.</td>', 'The title came up before the image and I was "wtf?", then it popped up and ROFL.  Excellent choice of title to go with image.', '2003-12-17 07:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(515338, 51184, 14401, '<td valign="top">An oldie but a goodie!</td>', 'An oldie but a goodie!', '2003-12-17 07:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(515339, 51200, 11738, '<td valign="top">This would have had more impact if you had shot the keyholder much closer.  I think all that would have been needed is the the keyholder, key and car door handle.  The lights in the background and the window reflection on the car are distracting.  You also have a post running along the left edge of the photo.  Shooting this during the day might have been better.  Good idea though and keep shooting.</td>', 'This would have had more impact if you had shot the keyholder much closer.  I think all that would have been needed is the the keyholder, key and car door handle.  The lights in the background and the window reflection on the car are distracting.  You also have a post running along the left edge of the photo.  Shooting this during the day might have been better.  Good idea though and keep shooting.', '2003-12-17 07:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(515341, 51086, 14401, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, very picturesque.  Would like the bike to be just a little sharper, but overall,  I think this shot is fantastic.  I give you a 9.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, very picturesque.  Would like the bike to be just a little sharper, but overall,  I think this shot is fantastic.  I give you a 9.', '2003-12-17 07:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(515342, 50693, 11738, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture of a candid vehicle moment.  One of my favourites.  I also love that you have so nicely captured the brilliant colours of the bike, flag and hydrant.</td>', 'Excellent capture of a candid vehicle moment.  One of my favourites.  I also love that you have so nicely captured the brilliant colours of the bike, flag and hydrant.', '2003-12-17 07:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(515344, 50943, 14401, '<td valign="top">Very cute!</td>', 'Very cute!', '2003-12-17 07:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(515345, 50699, 11738, '<td valign="top">This made me laugh and brought back fond memories.  Loved Hot Wheels and still check them out when I walk by them in the toy aisles.  Nice motion capture, although a bot out of focus.  Too bad about the crease in the paper on the left.</td>', 'This made me laugh and brought back fond memories.  Loved Hot Wheels and still check them out when I walk by them in the toy aisles.  Nice motion capture, although a bot out of focus.  Too bad about the crease in the paper on the left.', '2003-12-17 07:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(515347, 50471, 14401, '<td valign="top">I really would have liked this much better without the bikes in the foreground.  The positioning didn''t allow for the sharpness you really needed on your subject.  The flag on the ground in the front was I''m sure an oversight.</td>', 'I really would have liked this much better without the bikes in the foreground.  The positioning didn''t allow for the sharpness you really needed on your subject.  The flag on the ground in the front was I''m sure an oversight.', '2003-12-17 07:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(515348, 50999, 11738, '<td valign="top">This looks awful familiar.  Must have seen this in a book omewhere... anyway, not important.  Good crop and love the sepia treatment.  Good job.  Man that is a TON of snow for this time of year.</td>', 'This looks awful familiar.  Must have seen this in a book omewhere... anyway, not important.  Good crop and love the sepia treatment.  Good job.  Man that is a TON of snow for this time of year.', '2003-12-17 07:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(515349, 50882, 14401, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  Colors are vibrant and I like moon shots :-)!</td>', 'Excellent!  Colors are vibrant and I like moon shots :-)!', '2003-12-17 07:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(515351, 50726, 14401, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, cropping is just right!</td>', 'Very nice shot, cropping is just right!', '2003-12-17 07:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(515352, 51061, 14401, '<td valign="top">Love it!  Very nice black and white study.</td>', 'Love it!  Very nice black and white study.', '2003-12-17 07:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(515354, 50881, 14401, '<td valign="top">Oldie Goldie!  Ours is an 8N that''s almost 60!</td>', 'Oldie Goldie!  Ours is an 8N that''s almost 60!', '2003-12-17 07:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(515355, 50490, 11738, '<td valign="top">Too bad about the extra tight crop on the left.  Very nice lighting, glad you were able to capture this on a sunny afternoon.  Seems to be slightly oversharpened with some edges looking very "choppy".</td>', 'Too bad about the extra tight crop on the left.  Very nice lighting, glad you were able to capture this on a sunny afternoon.  Seems to be slightly oversharpened with some edges looking very "choppy".', '2003-12-17 07:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(515356, 51151, 14401, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  Nice cropping.</td>', 'Good shot.  Nice cropping.', '2003-12-17 07:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(515358, 50749, 11738, '<td valign="top">LOVE the driver''s expression.  Looks like he''s saying "Move over Bub, or I''ll call my Mom..."  LOL!</td>', 'LOVE the driver''s expression.  Looks like he''s saying "Move over Bub, or I''ll call my Mom..."  LOL!', '2003-12-17 07:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
