(515409, 51133, 13759, '<td valign="top">Good colors of sunset. I like the shape of the horizon, with the ships. I saw many distracting elements here too: the car, itself, boards, semaphores and posts.</td>', 'Good colors of sunset. I like the shape of the horizon, with the ships. I saw many distracting elements here too: the car, itself, boards, semaphores and posts.', '2003-12-17 08:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(515410, 50882, 11440, '<td valign="top">Very good picture! max points!</td>', 'Very good picture! max points!', '2003-12-17 08:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(515413, 50471, 13759, '<td valign="top">At the first look I saw clearly the orange bike. At second my eyes can´t leave the blue bike on the bottom. Your original subject is very nice, but you have a lot of distracting elements. You can use the DOF to blur background and the zoom to close your angle of view or simply walk 2 steps in front. Getting your subject in a special place of the frame.</td>', 'At the first look I saw clearly the orange bike. At second my eyes can´t leave the blue bike on the bottom. Your original subject is very nice, but you have a lot of distracting elements. You can use the DOF to blur background and the zoom to close your angle of view or simply walk 2 steps in front. Getting your subject in a special place of the frame.', '2003-12-17 08:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(515421, 51134, 13759, '<td valign="top">Good panning! I like so much.</td>', 'Good panning! I like so much.', '2003-12-17 09:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(515422, 50765, 12922, '<td valign="top">almost missed the bird in this one, good shot!</td>', 'almost missed the bird in this one, good shot!', '2003-12-17 09:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(515424, 50997, 12922, '<td valign="top">Wow, great shot!  It almost looks like you stuck your head out the window to get this one =)</td>', 'Wow, great shot!  It almost looks like you stuck your head out the window to get this one =)', '2003-12-17 09:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
