(515451, 50703, 13136, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. Good lighting, color and framing (too bad you did not get the top of the wing). Would have been better if you would have been lucky enough to get them to take off toward you.</td>', 'Nice picture. Good lighting, color and framing (too bad you did not get the top of the wing). Would have been better if you would have been lucky enough to get them to take off toward you.', '2003-12-17 09:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
