(515555, 50881, 327, '<td valign="top">Good red and good subject for the challenge. Did you think about standing back so that the top of the exhaust pipe showed? Your white balance is good, and with the gravel I can appreciate your challenges for shooting this.</td>', 'Good red and good subject for the challenge. Did you think about standing back so that the top of the exhaust pipe showed? Your white balance is good, and with the gravel I can appreciate your challenges for shooting this.', '2003-12-17 10:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
