(515558, 50961, 327, '<td valign="top">Real nice colorful shot. I do think the focus could of been a bit sharper so that we could read the name of the ship. Here that would of benefited the shot. Not bad and a good shot to look at. Good luck.</td>', 'Real nice colorful shot. I do think the focus could of been a bit sharper so that we could read the name of the ship. Here that would of benefited the shot. Not bad and a good shot to look at. Good luck.', '2003-12-17 10:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
