(515947, 50687, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice night shot. Would score higher from me if it was in focus. The blurrines in the tress/post show that, but the motion of the bus was well captured.</td>', 'Nice night shot. Would score higher from me if it was in focus. The blurrines in the tress/post show that, but the motion of the bus was well captured.', '2003-12-17 16:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
