(515966, 51202, 327, '<td valign="top">I think we need more of the shot to justify this image in our minds. <br/>I have been to the Harley Museum and the Guggenheim so I have a good idea of the side car_ and two seater. The only area of true focus is very narrow and I doubt many will understand the shot. Here I think you needed to zoom out a bit more and add some dof. I will say the colors are very nice. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I think we need more of the shot to justify this image in our minds. I have been to the Harley Museum and the Guggenheim so I have a good idea of the side car_ and two seater. The only area of true focus is very narrow and I doubt many will understand the shot. Here I think you needed to zoom out a bit more and add some dof. I will say the colors are very nice. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-12-17 16:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
