(516245, 50999, 12428, '<td valign="top">I am not sure why the bicyle seemed to be "going away" from the image, whereas it should have been the main focus, if U had pan ur camera to capture less of the snow on the right , and left some room on the left so that the bicycle is caught "moving into the image", it will be a better composition, In my Opinion.</td>', 'I am not sure why the bicyle seemed to be "going away" from the image, whereas it should have been the main focus, if U had pan ur camera to capture less of the snow on the right , and left some room on the left so that the bicycle is caught "moving into the image", it will be a better composition, In my Opinion.', '2003-12-17 21:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
