(516254, 50467, 12428, '<td valign="top">the image is a tad "noisy" it will be better is u had moved in more and capture the image withou using Digital zoom (if u did use it), this will make ur image sharper. However I think the negative space being portrayed is powerful here. like the way U composed it.</td>', 'the image is a tad "noisy" it will be better is u had moved in more and capture the image withou using Digital zoom (if u did use it), this will make ur image sharper. However I think the negative space being portrayed is powerful here. like the way U composed it.', '2003-12-17 21:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(516256, 51047, 12428, '<td valign="top">hey i was so attracted to this... i am not sure why perhaps its the title that when hand in hand... like the "pastel" colour feel here, matched perfectly with the oldish russian cars.</td>', 'hey i was so attracted to this... i am not sure why perhaps its the title that when hand in hand... like the "pastel" colour feel here, matched perfectly with the oldish russian cars.', '2003-12-17 21:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
