(516327, 50676, 14620, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, but I think I''d like it even better if it wasn''t cropped so close to the vehicle, seems a little tight on top.  It is an interesting vehicle though.</td>', 'I really like this shot, but I think I''d like it even better if it wasn''t cropped so close to the vehicle, seems a little tight on top.  It is an interesting vehicle though.', '2003-12-17 22:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(516331, 50490, 14620, '<td valign="top">This shot has great color tones, I love the red against the green background.  It does seem a little close on the left side.  But overall, I think it''s a really nice photo.</td>', 'This shot has great color tones, I love the red against the green background.  It does seem a little close on the left side.  But overall, I think it''s a really nice photo.', '2003-12-17 22:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
