(516399, 50962, 10818, '<td valign="top">Thats a great photo.  Nice one !</td>', 'Thats a great photo.  Nice one !', '2003-12-17 23:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(516442, 50962, 5822, '<td valign="top">A beautiful scene to be sure, but it appears that 1/3rd of it is obscured by your inclusion of the bus in the right of the image. To me, this detracts from the photo as I don''t think the bus adds anything to the image. There isn''t any nice reflection in it''s windows, and it''s black color makes the picture darker. It gives me a feeling of frustration as I want to peer around and see what''s on the other side.</td>', 'A beautiful scene to be sure, but it appears that 1/3rd of it is obscured by your inclusion of the bus in the right of the image. To me, this detracts from the photo as I don''t think the bus adds anything to the image. There isn''t any nice reflection in it''s windows, and it''s black color makes the picture darker. It gives me a feeling of frustration as I want to peer around and see what''s on the other side.', '2003-12-18 00:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(516459, 51032, 8891, '<td valign="top">sorry about the 4, my finger slipped while reviewing pictures....much better than that....nice naturral tones that might have been saturated just a bit for oomph, but not enough to take the idea of the heat away...pity the tram or conveyance was not more left then you could have chopped down to get rid of the sloping fence in the rear.  different and not a toy car!</td>', 'sorry about the 4, my finger slipped while reviewing pictures....much better than that....nice naturral tones that might have been saturated just a bit for oomph, but not enough to take the idea of the heat away...pity the tram or conveyance was not more left then you could have chopped down to get rid of the sloping fence in the rear.  different and not a toy car!', '2003-12-18 01:44:05.000000', NULL, 1);
