(516533, 50875, 5728, '<td valign="top">Cool capture! You nearly froze the propeller even. The lighting on the underside of the one wing is very soft and works well together with the shadows on the opposite wing. This is my favourite shot and the only 10 I gave in this challenge.</td>', 'Cool capture! You nearly froze the propeller even. The lighting on the underside of the one wing is very soft and works well together with the shadows on the opposite wing. This is my favourite shot and the only 10 I gave in this challenge.', '2003-12-18 06:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(516534, 51074, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, good composition, although you have the horizon bang in the middle. Probably showing more of the top of the boat and therefore more of the sky would have come over better for me. The lower part of your image is pretty dark and you are losing some of the details of the side of the boat. Still one of the better pics in this challenge though (9)</td>', 'Nice idea, good composition, although you have the horizon bang in the middle. Probably showing more of the top of the boat and therefore more of the sky would have come over better for me. The lower part of your image is pretty dark and you are losing some of the details of the side of the boat. Still one of the better pics in this challenge though (9)', '2003-12-18 06:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
