(516824, 51123, 6073, '<td valign="top">That''s a toy car on a rock!  hahahahahhahahaha  <br/> <br/>&lt;p&gt;Is the backdrop a PEAK &lt;img<br/>src="//samsclub.rebateplus.com/images/rebateimages/y2002/PeakAntifreeze_S.jpg"&gt;<br/>&amp;nbsp; Antifreeze jug&lt;/p&gt;<br/> <br/>At first I wasn''t sure why the car was vertical, but the title puts it together.  Is it your desire to own a Ferrari driving you up the wall, or that exact car racing around your house?</td>', 'That''s a toy car on a rock!  hahahahahhahahaha   <p>Is the backdrop a PEAK <imgsrc="//samsclub.rebateplus.com/images/rebateimages/y2002/PeakAntifreeze_S.jpg">&nbsp; Antifreeze jug</p> At first I wasn''t sure why the car was vertical, but the title puts it together.  Is it your desire to own a Ferrari driving you up the wall, or that exact car racing around your house?', '2003-12-18 12:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
