(516938, 51047, 10047, '<td valign="top">I might have tried a closer crop and taken out the trees on the left. Is it true that they install rear windshield defrosters on russian cars so you can keep your hands warm while you are pushing them?</td>', 'I might have tried a closer crop and taken out the trees on the left. Is it true that they install rear windshield defrosters on russian cars so you can keep your hands warm while you are pushing them?', '2003-12-18 15:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(516944, 51009, 14593, '<td valign="top">interesting approach....I do like the angle!</td>', 'interesting approach....I do like the angle!', '2003-12-18 16:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(516945, 50703, 14593, '<td valign="top">very nice photo.....you captured the moment well</td>', 'very nice photo.....you captured the moment well', '2003-12-18 16:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(516946, 50750, 14593, '<td valign="top">creative idea!  I like it!</td>', 'creative idea!  I like it!', '2003-12-18 16:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(516948, 50943, 14593, '<td valign="top">very creative</td>', 'very creative', '2003-12-18 16:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(516964, 50875, 14603, '<td valign="top">Like the way the light has picked out the detail on the plane and the clear blue sky acts as the perfect backdrop. Great picture.</td>', 'Like the way the light has picked out the detail on the plane and the clear blue sky acts as the perfect backdrop. Great picture.', '2003-12-18 17:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(516981, 51104, 14547, '<td valign="top">This was almost an really really good shot, if the background was exposed more this would be perfect</td>', 'This was almost an really really good shot, if the background was exposed more this would be perfect', '2003-12-18 18:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(516985, 51083, 14477, '<td valign="top">Looks like Orlando...am I right??</td>', 'Looks like Orlando...am I right??', '2003-12-18 18:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(516987, 51074, 10819, '<td valign="top">I love this photo. I like the composition, the subject..the colours..everything..perfect 10</td>', 'I love this photo. I like the composition, the subject..the colours..everything..perfect 10', '2003-12-18 18:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(516989, 51035, 10819, '<td valign="top">I love the snow, so it''s no suprise that I love this photo..i also love that its b&amp;w..makes for a striking photo..10</td>', 'I love the snow, so it''s no suprise that I love this photo..i also love that its b&w..makes for a striking photo..10', '2003-12-18 18:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(516993, 51021, 10819, '<td valign="top">out of all the bike pictures this challenge, i like yours the best..possibly because its not the average back photo..also i love the bright orange wall. ''9''</td>', 'out of all the bike pictures this challenge, i like yours the best..possibly because its not the average back photo..also i love the bright orange wall. ''9''', '2003-12-18 18:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(517000, 51021, 347, '<td valign="top">Nice shadow -- how did you get the bike to stand up?</td>', 'Nice shadow -- how did you get the bike to stand up?', '2003-12-18 18:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(517004, 51202, 12179, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites of the crop. Was this a model you put together? When I was 5 my Granny Whisnant bought be a model like this....keep up the keen work!</td>', 'This is one of my favorites of the crop. Was this a model you put together? When I was 5 my Granny Whisnant bought be a model like this....keep up the keen work!', '2003-12-18 18:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(517036, 51180, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great portrait! and even though the main subject is the boy and not the sled, I gave you a high mark.  Only issue I have with the picture is the soft focus. Other than that, I like it very much. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Great portrait! and even though the main subject is the boy and not the sled, I gave you a high mark.  Only issue I have with the picture is the soft focus. Other than that, I like it very much. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-12-18 19:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(517043, 51010, 5822, '<td valign="top">Though this appears to be a model car, the image looks so good the car almost looks real.  I love the gold color.  Only thing is it appears a bit dark. Good luck.</td>', 'Though this appears to be a model car, the image looks so good the car almost looks real.  I love the gold color.  Only thing is it appears a bit dark. Good luck.', '2003-12-18 19:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(517047, 51086, 5822, '<td valign="top">The photo is wonderful! Great night shot, but the predominant emphaisis here is on the scene and the gold tones which are very striking, not on the bicycle. Whlie adding a nice touch of quaintness and provinciality, the bike almost gets lost and does not seem to be the main subject.</td>', 'The photo is wonderful! Great night shot, but the predominant emphaisis here is on the scene and the gold tones which are very striking, not on the bicycle. Whlie adding a nice touch of quaintness and provinciality, the bike almost gets lost and does not seem to be the main subject.', '2003-12-18 19:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(517060, 51030, 2158, '<td valign="top">My preference would be to crop out the left hand side (and perhaps that thick white streak at the top).  Having the car so close to the centre just doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'My preference would be to crop out the left hand side (and perhaps that thick white streak at the top).  Having the car so close to the centre just doesn''t work for me.', '2003-12-18 20:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(517069, 50510, 13648, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. The angle is a bit much though.</td>', 'Nice shot. The angle is a bit much though.', '2003-12-18 20:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(517072, 51060, 13648, '<td valign="top">Neat idea! I think it would have been better if all of the truck were in focus.</td>', 'Neat idea! I think it would have been better if all of the truck were in focus.', '2003-12-18 20:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(517074, 51130, 12160, '<td valign="top">nice framing</td>', 'nice framing', '2003-12-18 20:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(517075, 50697, 12160, '<td valign="top">Makes me think that the train is secondary in this photo.</td>', 'Makes me think that the train is secondary in this photo.', '2003-12-18 20:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(517080, 50881, 12160, '<td valign="top">Good composition. I''d like to see this with more saturated color and more sharpness to give a real boost. Lighting is not bad.</td>', 'Good composition. I''d like to see this with more saturated color and more sharpness to give a real boost. Lighting is not bad.', '2003-12-18 20:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(517081, 50999, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice use of sepia tone... gives the photo some warmth.</td>', 'Nice use of sepia tone... gives the photo some warmth.', '2003-12-18 20:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(517086, 51110, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice shot... good movement and framing. I''d like to see the biker sharper and the photo bigger.</td>', 'Nice shot... good movement and framing. I''d like to see the biker sharper and the photo bigger.', '2003-12-18 20:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(517088, 51099, 9581, '<td valign="top">I like she is so cute!</td>', 'I like she is so cute!', '2003-12-18 20:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(517089, 50612, 9581, '<td valign="top">SUPER GREAT! Good in color and details!</td>', 'SUPER GREAT! Good in color and details!', '2003-12-18 20:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(517091, 50718, 9581, '<td valign="top">Oh too cute!Nice in the black in white! My 3 year old son would love that ride!</td>', 'Oh too cute!Nice in the black in white! My 3 year old son would love that ride!', '2003-12-18 20:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(517093, 50726, 12160, '<td valign="top">Love the "flow" in this photo. Great composition with the circles in the diagonal. Couple of hot spots but over all a nice shot.</td>', 'Love the "flow" in this photo. Great composition with the circles in the diagonal. Couple of hot spots but over all a nice shot.', '2003-12-18 20:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(517094, 50996, 11096, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this picture and all the color.</td>', 'I like the composition of this picture and all the color.', '2003-12-18 20:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
