(517096, 50979, 7252, '<td valign="top">The car is a little too dark for me. The red doesn''t really contribute. Assuming the background was originally white and not the shade of grey shown in the final image I think it''s a little under exposed. If your camera has the capability I would dial in a +1 - +2 EV so the camera doesn''t meter the white a middle grey. Good placement of the car in the frame.</td>', 'The car is a little too dark for me. The red doesn''t really contribute. Assuming the background was originally white and not the shade of grey shown in the final image I think it''s a little under exposed. If your camera has the capability I would dial in a +1 - +2 EV so the camera doesn''t meter the white a middle grey. Good placement of the car in the frame.', '2003-12-18 20:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
