(517593, 50723, 5158, '<td valign="top">Great secenery, well captured. Due to the rain and the sapia it gives a very special feeling. I do not like the small size and the frame very much, but the cropping is well chosen. One of my very few favorits this week and I give it a 9. good luck to you.</td>', 'Great secenery, well captured. Due to the rain and the sapia it gives a very special feeling. I do not like the small size and the frame very much, but the cropping is well chosen. One of my very few favorits this week and I give it a 9. good luck to you.', '2003-12-19 07:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(517594, 51061, 5158, '<td valign="top">Great composition, greatly executed: I like that B&amp;W was chosen, the angle of view, that the DOF is large. Also the background looks great, because it gives the image a "past-time"-feeling. Only the bright upper right corner does not fit well. <br/>To me a winner (10)</td>', 'Great composition, greatly executed: I like that B&W was chosen, the angle of view, that the DOF is large. Also the background looks great, because it gives the image a "past-time"-feeling. Only the bright upper right corner does not fit well. To me a winner (10)', '2003-12-19 07:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(517596, 51084, 5158, '<td valign="top">Great submission, although it''s cropped a little tight at the top. I like the curved road, the reflexions on it, als well as the great background of the silo  with its periodic structures. Sapia work very well too and the frame is OK. Good luck to you (9)</td>', 'Great submission, although it''s cropped a little tight at the top. I like the curved road, the reflexions on it, als well as the great background of the silo  with its periodic structures. Sapia work very well too and the frame is OK. Good luck to you (9)', '2003-12-19 07:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(517600, 50697, 5158, '<td valign="top">A very strong entry with a great red color. I like that it is in parts overexposed. The lack of sharpeness disturbes a little, but not to much: I can feel the train shaking. The pose of the girl and the way she looks fit well to. Good job and good luck.</td>', 'A very strong entry with a great red color. I like that it is in parts overexposed. The lack of sharpeness disturbes a little, but not to much: I can feel the train shaking. The pose of the girl and the way she looks fit well to. Good job and good luck.', '2003-12-19 07:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(517604, 50656, 14880, '<td valign="top">good picture<br/></td>', 'good picture', '2003-12-19 08:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(517642, 50882, 8643, '<td valign="top">This truly brilliant.</td>', 'This truly brilliant.', '2003-12-19 09:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
