(517669, 51199, 10705, '<td valign="top">I like your idea with this photo.  The front part of the track needs to be in focus, and I think if you waited until the first car was coming right at you, it would have more impact.  That way, you''d still see the rest of the cars coming ''round the bend!<br/>This photo''s definitely worth trying again.  Photo also looks a little dark, at least on my monitor.  Hope this helps.</td>', 'I like your idea with this photo.  The front part of the track needs to be in focus, and I think if you waited until the first car was coming right at you, it would have more impact.  That way, you''d still see the rest of the cars coming ''round the bend!This photo''s definitely worth trying again.  Photo also looks a little dark, at least on my monitor.  Hope this helps.', '2003-12-19 10:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(517680, 51041, 10350, '<td valign="top">great picture but you should have waited for another challenge with this one. but 10 for a great picture</td>', 'great picture but you should have waited for another challenge with this one. but 10 for a great picture', '2003-12-19 10:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(517681, 50799, 10705, '<td valign="top">If you zoomed in closer on the monorail, it would eliminate the ride on the right and still show epcot. Also, if you eliminate the part just below the track, it would give your photo more impact.  Nice shot of the monorail, tho.</td>', 'If you zoomed in closer on the monorail, it would eliminate the ride on the right and still show epcot. Also, if you eliminate the part just below the track, it would give your photo more impact.  Nice shot of the monorail, tho.', '2003-12-19 10:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
