(519132, 50363, 6172, '<td valign="top">A most simplistic of vehicles indeed!  Decent photo, just a little dark in some areas.</td>', 'A most simplistic of vehicles indeed!  Decent photo, just a little dark in some areas.', '2003-12-21 17:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
