(519456, 50510, 9643, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like everything about this photo - the colors, the clarity and the angle of presentation.  10</td>', 'Very nice.  I like everything about this photo - the colors, the clarity and the angle of presentation.  10', '2003-12-22 00:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(519641, 50821, 3540, '<td valign="top">You could''ve went a lot of ways with this car.  The general angle is good but I think its just a little too close up.  I like the way the lines lead us into the picture, but they should lead us to a little bit more that the very bottom part of a windshield</td>', 'You could''ve went a lot of ways with this car.  The general angle is good but I think its just a little too close up.  I like the way the lines lead us into the picture, but they should lead us to a little bit more that the very bottom part of a windshield', '2003-12-22 06:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(519649, 51052, 3540, '<td valign="top">Awesome low key shot.  This is an outstanding shot in terms of conveying a mood.  nice work 9</td>', 'Awesome low key shot.  This is an outstanding shot in terms of conveying a mood.  nice work 9', '2003-12-22 06:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(519651, 51145, 3540, '<td valign="top">Interesting title, especially since I can''t imagine the girl actually driving this bike.  Background is way too busy on this one.</td>', 'Interesting title, especially since I can''t imagine the girl actually driving this bike.  Background is way too busy on this one.', '2003-12-22 06:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(519653, 51087, 3540, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like the lighting on this one.   The concept is very good though.</td>', 'I don''t really like the lighting on this one.   The concept is very good though.', '2003-12-22 07:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(519655, 50858, 3540, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the angle of the car in this one.  I think it would''ve looked a lot more imposing to make the front higher than the back instead of vice versa.  It would''ve given this car a little more power and prestige.</td>', 'I don''t like the angle of the car in this one.  I think it would''ve looked a lot more imposing to make the front higher than the back instead of vice versa.  It would''ve given this car a little more power and prestige.', '2003-12-22 07:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(519659, 51136, 3540, '<td valign="top">Love the concept of the shot.  But I think the sled is a little crowded in the picture.  I think the lighting is a little to thin as well.  It could''ve been a little brighter which might''ve also lessened your shutter speed and made the picture a trite bit clearer as well.</td>', 'Love the concept of the shot.  But I think the sled is a little crowded in the picture.  I think the lighting is a little to thin as well.  It could''ve been a little brighter which might''ve also lessened your shutter speed and made the picture a trite bit clearer as well.', '2003-12-22 07:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(519664, 50676, 3540, '<td valign="top">Unless there was some reason for cutting this picture down so low, I would''ve given this beauty a little more head room.  It seems unnaturally tight on top.</td>', 'Unless there was some reason for cutting this picture down so low, I would''ve given this beauty a little more head room.  It seems unnaturally tight on top.', '2003-12-22 07:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(519669, 50726, 3540, '<td valign="top">This angle is not conducive to chrome, as you have put yourself in the picture with your head just above the "S" in Hudson.  A slight change in the angle would''ve gone a long way with this shot, and not just in regards to you being in the photo.</td>', 'This angle is not conducive to chrome, as you have put yourself in the picture with your head just above the "S" in Hudson.  A slight change in the angle would''ve gone a long way with this shot, and not just in regards to you being in the photo.', '2003-12-22 07:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(519675, 50656, 3540, '<td valign="top">You''ve done a great job with this one.  This is one of the few toys that actually looks real, or its actually a car and it looks like a toy.  Whatever the case, I''m at least thinking that I''m fooled on this one.  I haven''t been giving the toys very good scores in general either.</td>', 'You''ve done a great job with this one.  This is one of the few toys that actually looks real, or its actually a car and it looks like a toy.  Whatever the case, I''m at least thinking that I''m fooled on this one.  I haven''t been giving the toys very good scores in general either.', '2003-12-22 07:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(519680, 51207, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is real close to being very good.  If it were me, I''d have a little more light, make this a little clearer and back up just a couple feet.  The car is a great subject too.</td>', 'This is real close to being very good.  If it were me, I''d have a little more light, make this a little clearer and back up just a couple feet.  The car is a great subject too.', '2003-12-22 07:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(519683, 51121, 3540, '<td valign="top">A steel wheeler.  Good find!  DId you consider greyscaling this one?  I think it is a worthy candidate of making a simulated old photo.</td>', 'A steel wheeler.  Good find!  DId you consider greyscaling this one?  I think it is a worthy candidate of making a simulated old photo.', '2003-12-22 07:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(519684, 50467, 3540, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  The sky is pixelated and grainy to the max on this picture.  I think the negative space would''ve been good, if it wasn''t so distracting.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  The sky is pixelated and grainy to the max on this picture.  I think the negative space would''ve been good, if it wasn''t so distracting.', '2003-12-22 07:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(519688, 51197, 3540, '<td valign="top">A little too much playing with photoshop on this one.  Were you having fun with the curves adjustments?  More digital art than photography and that doesn''t bode well in my book.</td>', 'A little too much playing with photoshop on this one.  Were you having fun with the curves adjustments?  More digital art than photography and that doesn''t bode well in my book.', '2003-12-22 07:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(519945, 51180, 3540, '<td valign="top">Altogether not too bad.  Its kind of on the cusp of not sharp enough, but as a portrait, I think its okay to not be pin sharp.  I like the high-keyness of it, but you should''ve given him a little more "living" room, or room around him.  This really tight crop is a little constrictive.  This is a pretty recognizable kid too, esp sporting his Happy Valley garb, but I''ve been wrong before....</td>', 'Altogether not too bad.  Its kind of on the cusp of not sharp enough, but as a portrait, I think its okay to not be pin sharp.  I like the high-keyness of it, but you should''ve given him a little more "living" room, or room around him.  This really tight crop is a little constrictive.  This is a pretty recognizable kid too, esp sporting his Happy Valley garb, but I''ve been wrong before....', '2003-12-22 12:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(519986, 50697, 4049, '<td valign="top">blurry, otherwise would be nice.</td>', 'blurry, otherwise would be nice.', '2003-12-22 12:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(520028, 51054, 9411, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the title, but this is a fabulous image. Very welldone.  10</td>', 'Not sure about the title, but this is a fabulous image. Very welldone.  10', '2003-12-22 14:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(520039, 50947, 10546, '<td valign="top">Nice feet! Sorry about the flash shadow...</td>', 'Nice feet! Sorry about the flash shadow...', '2003-12-22 14:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(520067, 50558, 9651, '<td valign="top">That is awesome</td>', 'That is awesome', '2003-12-22 15:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(520068, 51146, 9651, '<td valign="top">That''s just...aweful</td>', 'That''s just...aweful', '2003-12-22 15:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(520080, 50665, 10858, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the urban landscape and the vehicle for fields, red gives it a character in front of whites and greens. IMHO just a little bit shallower DOF would have helped to smoosh the busy background. Alltogether nicely done!</td>', 'I like the contrast between the urban landscape and the vehicle for fields, red gives it a character in front of whites and greens. IMHO just a little bit shallower DOF would have helped to smoosh the busy background. Alltogether nicely done!', '2003-12-22 15:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(520083, 50510, 10858, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection of coulds on the car, and the perspective - photographing from the ground. Otherwise the blow out - I guess it''s the sun - is a bit distracting, and the photo is tilting too much. I feel that the car would roll down from the photo, I would have used a smaller angle for the rotation and the fround could end in the right bottom corner. Jut an opinion.</td>', 'I like the reflection of coulds on the car, and the perspective - photographing from the ground. Otherwise the blow out - I guess it''s the sun - is a bit distracting, and the photo is tilting too much. I feel that the car would roll down from the photo, I would have used a smaller angle for the rotation and the fround could end in the right bottom corner. Jut an opinion.', '2003-12-22 15:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(520085, 50622, 10785, '<td valign="top">Before the challenge ends, I just want to record that I believe this is a photo by Pitsaman.<br/> <br/>(Sorry if I''m wrong, but I just thought I might be able to pick his style of photography from a crowd.)</td>', 'Before the challenge ends, I just want to record that I believe this is a photo by Pitsaman. (Sorry if I''m wrong, but I just thought I might be able to pick his style of photography from a crowd.)', '2003-12-22 15:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(520109, 51127, 10858, '<td valign="top">I would have used a tripod here, the tree in the background hass moved in. Some harsh lights have blowed out, too, and I would like to see a bit more breathing space in front of the car on the right. Otherwise I like the idea, just a bit more practise needed for the techniques.</td>', 'I would have used a tripod here, the tree in the background hass moved in. Some harsh lights have blowed out, too, and I would like to see a bit more breathing space in front of the car on the right. Otherwise I like the idea, just a bit more practise needed for the techniques.', '2003-12-22 16:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(520112, 51156, 10858, '<td valign="top">I would like to see the front wheels here, crop is a bit tight on the right. Otherwise a good photo, and B&amp;W works well here.</td>', 'I would like to see the front wheels here, crop is a bit tight on the right. Otherwise a good photo, and B&W works well here.', '2003-12-22 16:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(520119, 51132, 10858, '<td valign="top">Original Idea, I like it a much! :-) For my taste crop is a bit tight on the right, and the colums shouldn''t be there. I know, it''s a fire department equipment, but it cuts the vehicle to 2 parts. Lighting on the fire engine works well, it leads my eyes and gives a character to the vehicle.</td>', 'Original Idea, I like it a much! :-) For my taste crop is a bit tight on the right, and the colums shouldn''t be there. I know, it''s a fire department equipment, but it cuts the vehicle to 2 parts. Lighting on the fire engine works well, it leads my eyes and gives a character to the vehicle.', '2003-12-22 16:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(520124, 50474, 10858, '<td valign="top">Cute photo, nice emotions here. Otherwise I don''t think this Seal would be a vehicle. Well, maybe in children''s fantasy, that''s true, but I am not sure about voters associate to it immediately.</td>', 'Cute photo, nice emotions here. Otherwise I don''t think this Seal would be a vehicle. Well, maybe in children''s fantasy, that''s true, but I am not sure about voters associate to it immediately.', '2003-12-22 16:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(520136, 51059, 10858, '<td valign="top">This is funny. :-) Nice composition and idea, first I thought it was noisy, but I realised it was just the texture and the propeller spinning. I would have used a more homogenic background here - maybe a cardback paper -, this one ruins a lot on your photo. Shame, I would love it without this distracting thing.</td>', 'This is funny. :-) Nice composition and idea, first I thought it was noisy, but I realised it was just the texture and the propeller spinning. I would have used a more homogenic background here - maybe a cardback paper -, this one ruins a lot on your photo. Shame, I would love it without this distracting thing.', '2003-12-22 16:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(520149, 51133, 10858, '<td valign="top">The most accented part of your photo is the road sign, my eyes are led there, and a bit busy for me. The car itself being bigger and not that dark with the same coloured sky would be excellent for my taste, anyway.</td>', 'The most accented part of your photo is the road sign, my eyes are led there, and a bit busy for me. The car itself being bigger and not that dark with the same coloured sky would be excellent for my taste, anyway.', '2003-12-22 16:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(520154, 51087, 10858, '<td valign="top">I would have cleaned it before photographing (dust and solid oil), would be a very good vehicle part that way. I also would use a homogenic background, for example a simple deep black one, it would make it effective, too.</td>', 'I would have cleaned it before photographing (dust and solid oil), would be a very good vehicle part that way. I also would use a homogenic background, for example a simple deep black one, it would make it effective, too.', '2003-12-22 16:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(520159, 50477, 10858, '<td valign="top">I would have used a longer shutter to make the wheel really have a spinning feeling. :-) I also would have cropped it to a square as a circle is a fll symmetric shape and the blow out on the wheel (is it a lighting bulb or a flash) is a bit distracting. Original idea, I would improve it a bit more if I were you.</td>', 'I would have used a longer shutter to make the wheel really have a spinning feeling. :-) I also would have cropped it to a square as a circle is a fll symmetric shape and the blow out on the wheel (is it a lighting bulb or a flash) is a bit distracting. Original idea, I would improve it a bit more if I were you.', '2003-12-22 16:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(520162, 50413, 10858, '<td valign="top">Original idea. :-)  I would like to see this photo bigger, and I would have cropped the sky as it being so white leads my eyes away from the car. Just a bit improvement, it would be a very nice shot!</td>', 'Original idea. :-)  I would like to see this photo bigger, and I would have cropped the sky as it being so white leads my eyes away from the car. Just a bit improvement, it would be a very nice shot!', '2003-12-22 16:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(520165, 51088, 10858, '<td valign="top">Too much blow outs and too purple for my taste. The idea is very nice, and composition would be okay, too, but...</td>', 'Too much blow outs and too purple for my taste. The idea is very nice, and composition would be okay, too, but...', '2003-12-22 16:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(520170, 51149, 10858, '<td valign="top">Cool. :-) I like the negative space you used here. Nice hi-key photo, just a little thing: I am not sure about the white blow outs on the plane''s blacks. Alltogether a good photo IMHO.</td>', 'Cool. :-) I like the negative space you used here. Nice hi-key photo, just a little thing: I am not sure about the white blow outs on the plane''s blacks. Alltogether a good photo IMHO.', '2003-12-22 16:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(520179, 50774, 10858, '<td valign="top">Original idea with the peace mark and the flower. Made me laugh. :-) Take an extra point for cheering me up. :-)</td>', 'Original idea with the peace mark and the flower. Made me laugh. :-) Take an extra point for cheering me up. :-)', '2003-12-22 16:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(520182, 51145, 10858, '<td valign="top">I would have included the whole vehicle on the photo, it''s so beauutiful, why not show us the whole? I am not interested in the girls, this is a vehicle challenge, and they can add a nice element to the vehicle, IF the vehicle is your main subject. Now I feel you photographed the girls with the vehicle and not the vehicle with the girls - if you know what I mean.</td>', 'I would have included the whole vehicle on the photo, it''s so beauutiful, why not show us the whole? I am not interested in the girls, this is a vehicle challenge, and they can add a nice element to the vehicle, IF the vehicle is your main subject. Now I feel you photographed the girls with the vehicle and not the vehicle with the girls - if you know what I mean.', '2003-12-22 16:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(520185, 51077, 10858, '<td valign="top">Crop is a bit tight on the leftm and the "nose" of the car is blurry. I also wouls have photographed from a higher angle to show the texts, logos and numbers on the car. Could be improved a bit, otherwise a very unique idea.</td>', 'Crop is a bit tight on the leftm and the "nose" of the car is blurry. I also wouls have photographed from a higher angle to show the texts, logos and numbers on the car. Could be improved a bit, otherwise a very unique idea.', '2003-12-22 17:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(520190, 50612, 10858, '<td valign="top">Unique! And very well presented. :-) Few but effective colours, very nice composition, and my first 10 points after voting for 20% of the photos! Congrats, good luck, I keep my fingers crossed for you!</td>', 'Unique! And very well presented. :-) Few but effective colours, very nice composition, and my first 10 points after voting for 20% of the photos! Congrats, good luck, I keep my fingers crossed for you!', '2003-12-22 17:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(520192, 50750, 10858, '<td valign="top">Unique idea and negative space works well, take 10 from me. :-)</td>', 'Unique idea and negative space works well, take 10 from me. :-)', '2003-12-22 17:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(520196, 51010, 10858, '<td valign="top">So wonderful photo of metal, and amazing diagonal composition, love it! I would have included the front left tyre to thr photo, this is why I give you only a 9... My heart aches for that point minus, but it being left out distracts me a bit...</td>', 'So wonderful photo of metal, and amazing diagonal composition, love it! I would have included the front left tyre to thr photo, this is why I give you only a 9... My heart aches for that point minus, but it being left out distracts me a bit...', '2003-12-22 17:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(520206, 51124, 10858, '<td valign="top">I would have included the negative space in the moving direction. I guess you wanted to follow the rule of thirds with the front wheel, anyway with vehicles the space for moving is more important for me. Otherwise a nice B&amp;W shot. :-)</td>', 'I would have included the negative space in the moving direction. I guess you wanted to follow the rule of thirds with the front wheel, anyway with vehicles the space for moving is more important for me. Otherwise a nice B&W shot. :-)', '2003-12-22 17:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(520207, 50467, 10858, '<td valign="top">The photo is noisy (grainy) and cars are too small. Would be nice idea for a negative space challenge, here I would like to see a little bit more of the vehicles.</td>', 'The photo is noisy (grainy) and cars are too small. Would be nice idea for a negative space challenge, here I would like to see a little bit more of the vehicles.', '2003-12-22 17:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
