(520635, 51093, 10858, '<td valign="top">Good photo, but I wouldn''t understand it without the title. I had some experiences here and I think sometimes photos that rise thoughts and are not really understandable without further thoughts don''t tho that well as they should. Just a suggestion from a beginner. :-)</td>', 'Good photo, but I wouldn''t understand it without the title. I had some experiences here and I think sometimes photos that rise thoughts and are not really understandable without further thoughts don''t tho that well as they should. Just a suggestion from a beginner. :-)', '2003-12-23 05:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
