(521280, 51136, 14593, '<td valign="top">wow.....great action shot!</td>', 'wow.....great action shot!', '2003-12-23 19:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(521281, 51100, 14593, '<td valign="top">In this photo the road does look lonely....love the muted colors...nice composition too</td>', 'In this photo the road does look lonely....love the muted colors...nice composition too', '2003-12-23 19:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(521283, 50805, 14593, '<td valign="top">I like the different composition.....</td>', 'I like the different composition.....', '2003-12-23 19:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(521284, 50814, 14593, '<td valign="top">creative photo.....very different!!</td>', 'creative photo.....very different!!', '2003-12-23 19:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(521285, 51185, 14593, '<td valign="top">creative idea....well photographed too</td>', 'creative idea....well photographed too', '2003-12-23 19:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(521286, 50612, 14593, '<td valign="top">interesting photo.....I like it</td>', 'interesting photo.....I like it', '2003-12-23 19:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(521288, 51086, 8816, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!  I love the composition, and it definetly applies to the challenge.  Maybe a bit more concentration on the bike would''ve helped a bit thoguh, my attention is drawn to the bridge at the moment.  I would like to see this in black and white, or sepia!  Nicely done nonetheless! 8</td>', 'Very nice shot!  I love the composition, and it definetly applies to the challenge.  Maybe a bit more concentration on the bike would''ve helped a bit thoguh, my attention is drawn to the bridge at the moment.  I would like to see this in black and white, or sepia!  Nicely done nonetheless! 8', '2003-12-23 19:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(521301, 51110, 9906, '<td valign="top">Too little, not sharp enough and dull in color.<br/>TC</td>', 'Too little, not sharp enough and dull in color.TC', '2003-12-23 20:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(521302, 50474, 9906, '<td valign="top">Where''s the vehicle?<br/>TC</td>', 'Where''s the vehicle?TC', '2003-12-23 20:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(521303, 51093, 9906, '<td valign="top">Where''s the vehicle?<br/>TC</td>', 'Where''s the vehicle?TC', '2003-12-23 20:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(521304, 51085, 9906, '<td valign="top">Where''s the vehicle?</td>', 'Where''s the vehicle?', '2003-12-23 20:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(521308, 51152, 14509, '<td valign="top">very nice subject for this challenge. Yes, it transports a lot of animals and people. Good idea. Well done.</td>', 'very nice subject for this challenge. Yes, it transports a lot of animals and people. Good idea. Well done.', '2003-12-23 20:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(521313, 50467, 14012, '<td valign="top">I like the use of negative space here. However, this would have looked much better if you were able to clean up some of the noise in the sky. 7</td>', 'I like the use of negative space here. However, this would have looked much better if you were able to clean up some of the noise in the sky. 7', '2003-12-23 21:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(521314, 51175, 14012, '<td valign="top">Nice, although the reflection in the glass is disctracting.</td>', 'Nice, although the reflection in the glass is disctracting.', '2003-12-23 21:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(521317, 50379, 14012, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite out of all the photos of commercial planes. I think the angle you used was unique.</td>', 'This is my favorite out of all the photos of commercial planes. I think the angle you used was unique.', '2003-12-23 21:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(521319, 50952, 14012, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a little harsh, as it looks like it was taken mid-day. The trees in the top right are really over exposed. 5</td>', 'Lighting is a little harsh, as it looks like it was taken mid-day. The trees in the top right are really over exposed. 5', '2003-12-23 21:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(521320, 51179, 14012, '<td valign="top">Creative. I like the headlight shining through the snow. 7</td>', 'Creative. I like the headlight shining through the snow. 7', '2003-12-23 21:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(521323, 50476, 14012, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming this was taken during flight, that being how you relate it to the challenge. A stretch to me. <br/> <br/>On to the technical aspects of the photo.. There is a bad relection, I''m assuming because this was taken through a window and the sky is a dull blue. If you can use a polarizing filter, that would help with both issues. There also seems to be some pixelation in the sky.</td>', 'I''m assuming this was taken during flight, that being how you relate it to the challenge. A stretch to me.  On to the technical aspects of the photo.. There is a bad relection, I''m assuming because this was taken through a window and the sky is a dull blue. If you can use a polarizing filter, that would help with both issues. There also seems to be some pixelation in the sky.', '2003-12-23 21:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(521326, 51094, 14012, '<td valign="top">Overexposed and out of focus.</td>', 'Overexposed and out of focus.', '2003-12-23 21:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(521330, 51197, 14012, '<td valign="top">A long exposure that is too over-processed, IMHO. Hard to really tell what it is.</td>', 'A long exposure that is too over-processed, IMHO. Hard to really tell what it is.', '2003-12-23 21:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(521343, 51010, 12160, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, love the tones used here although a little too dark and the top right blends too well with the background. Still a nice photo.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, love the tones used here although a little too dark and the top right blends too well with the background. Still a nice photo.', '2003-12-23 21:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(521344, 50379, 12160, '<td valign="top">I love the sharpness and colors of this photo.</td>', 'I love the sharpness and colors of this photo.', '2003-12-23 21:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(521345, 50726, 8891, '<td valign="top">See the mcfarland shot was was tighter and with a slight CCW rotatinos so that the wheel fender and the spare carrier were level.   THis however looks more natural from many respects and I like as much if not more.  very nice, like the reflections in the chrome....still think a slight CCW rotation might have made the detail lines straighter  and more please if only to me.</td>', 'See the mcfarland shot was was tighter and with a slight CCW rotatinos so that the wheel fender and the spare carrier were level.   THis however looks more natural from many respects and I like as much if not more.  very nice, like the reflections in the chrome....still think a slight CCW rotation might have made the detail lines straighter  and more please if only to me.', '2003-12-23 21:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(521346, 50693, 8891, '<td valign="top">LOL nice catch! Like the backlighting and the shadows and the fact that the guy is acutally looking before he crosess the interesection.  Love all the bright colors on and around the subject.   Well done!</td>', 'LOL nice catch! Like the backlighting and the shadows and the fact that the guy is acutally looking before he crosess the interesection.  Love all the bright colors on and around the subject.   Well done!', '2003-12-23 21:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(521348, 50697, 8891, '<td valign="top">This is pretty nice, i''m not happy about the over exposure, perhaps you were going for an effect....the model looks almost mannequin like so a more natural look on her would have been appreciated.  I like the movement seen through the windows but the colors really clash because of the brightness. The thin frame can go, totally un necessary and the color chose blends too much with the door so it is lost at the top right corner.</td>', 'This is pretty nice, i''m not happy about the over exposure, perhaps you were going for an effect....the model looks almost mannequin like so a more natural look on her would have been appreciated.  I like the movement seen through the windows but the colors really clash because of the brightness. The thin frame can go, totally un necessary and the color chose blends too much with the door so it is lost at the top right corner.', '2003-12-23 21:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(521351, 50729, 8891, '<td valign="top">I am by no means of fan of the glorifying new car shots, but I like this one because of your inclusion of the great neon lights and your ability to minimalize its reflections on the vehicle.  Fascinates for that reason.  Like it.</td>', 'I am by no means of fan of the glorifying new car shots, but I like this one because of your inclusion of the great neon lights and your ability to minimalize its reflections on the vehicle.  Fascinates for that reason.  Like it.', '2003-12-23 21:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(521353, 50858, 8891, '<td valign="top">Filled the frame too much and the limo look''s like it is about to tip over....with style of course.</td>', 'Filled the frame too much and the limo look''s like it is about to tip over....with style of course.', '2003-12-23 21:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(521355, 51062, 8891, '<td valign="top">silly, the evles to go with santa...santa should bgge in the sled and not the elf...preparations or not..  focus....like te facbric attempt at snow...almost looks OK.   The halo around the elf bothers me a bit.</td>', 'silly, the evles to go with santa...santa should bgge in the sled and not the elf...preparations or not..  focus....like te facbric attempt at snow...almost looks OK.   The halo around the elf bothers me a bit.', '2003-12-23 21:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(521357, 51093, 8891, '<td valign="top">not a  clue...interesting still life of the candle and the books, but not a clue as to how this relates to the challenge theme....I suppose the title says it all, unfortunately it does not to me.</td>', 'not a  clue...interesting still life of the candle and the books, but not a clue as to how this relates to the challenge theme....I suppose the title says it all, unfortunately it does not to me.', '2003-12-23 21:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(521360, 51180, 8891, '<td valign="top">The kid is cute, the BW image is very fine, but you cropped into much in the front so the sled is just about out of the picture.  NOTE: THE VEHICLE IS THE SUBJECT OF THE CHALLENGE NOT THE CUTE KID!  However thank you for not framing it and great portrait.</td>', 'The kid is cute, the BW image is very fine, but you cropped into much in the front so the sled is just about out of the picture.  NOTE: THE VEHICLE IS THE SUBJECT OF THE CHALLENGE NOT THE CUTE KID!  However thank you for not framing it and great portrait.', '2003-12-23 22:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(521361, 50821, 8891, '<td valign="top">Definitely needed to be color, BW just is not working for me here.</td>', 'Definitely needed to be color, BW just is not working for me here.', '2003-12-23 22:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(521362, 51132, 8891, '<td valign="top">Nicer find....shame about the pole but I guess there was no way around it.</td>', 'Nicer find....shame about the pole but I guess there was no way around it.', '2003-12-23 22:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(521363, 50982, 8891, '<td valign="top">NOTE THE CHALLENGE SUBJECT IS THE VEHICLE NOT THE BEAUTY OF MOUNT SHASTA!  That said... well really that''s all I can say...the subject semi looks like it just got in theway of a landscape shot.</td>', 'NOTE THE CHALLENGE SUBJECT IS THE VEHICLE NOT THE BEAUTY OF MOUNT SHASTA!  That said... well really that''s all I can say...the subject semi looks like it just got in theway of a landscape shot.', '2003-12-23 22:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(521364, 50810, 8891, '<td valign="top">I''m like the brigt colors of the land sail boat agains the natural tones of the mid background and also the texture contrasts between same as well as the perpindicularity of the sail to the slope of the sweeping fields. Pretty darn good.</td>', 'I''m like the brigt colors of the land sail boat agains the natural tones of the mid background and also the texture contrasts between same as well as the perpindicularity of the sail to the slope of the sweeping fields. Pretty darn good.', '2003-12-23 22:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(521366, 51147, 8891, '<td valign="top">to many reflective lights all around... they are distracting.</td>', 'to many reflective lights all around... they are distracting.', '2003-12-23 22:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(521369, 50467, 8891, '<td valign="top">don''t know if negative space was the way to go with this...it also looks sort of un-natural with the clouds so low and the deep blue above.... my mind is failing to grasp it.  Do not like the overall grainy look of the image.</td>', 'don''t know if negative space was the way to go with this...it also looks sort of un-natural with the clouds so low and the deep blue above.... my mind is failing to grasp it.  Do not like the overall grainy look of the image.', '2003-12-23 22:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(521371, 51065, 8891, '<td valign="top">I think you should have moved a bit to you left which might have provided a better angle as to what I was looking at.  I appreciate the tightness of this crop to show the repeated patterns of the pizzas on the trucks but feel that more a more angular shot would have emphasized that more.  Nice find.</td>', 'I think you should have moved a bit to you left which might have provided a better angle as to what I was looking at.  I appreciate the tightness of this crop to show the repeated patterns of the pizzas on the trucks but feel that more a more angular shot would have emphasized that more.  Nice find.', '2003-12-23 22:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(521372, 50723, 8891, '<td valign="top">like the tone used here, wish the subject did not have the appearance of falling out of the frame....cropped to close at the bottom...nice scene otherwise.</td>', 'like the tone used here, wish the subject did not have the appearance of falling out of the frame....cropped to close at the bottom...nice scene otherwise.', '2003-12-23 22:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(521374, 50510, 8891, '<td valign="top">This angle is way too severe. Nice otherwise except for the giant sun flare on the wall.  Great POV.</td>', 'This angle is way too severe. Nice otherwise except for the giant sun flare on the wall.  Great POV.', '2003-12-23 22:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(521376, 50951, 8891, '<td valign="top">read up on your camera''s white balance settings, please  subject is nice ...wish the driver was not in the way of the horse. Cropped to close on the right at the rear of the full carriage in the shot.</td>', 'read up on your camera''s white balance settings, please  subject is nice ...wish the driver was not in the way of the horse. Cropped to close on the right at the rear of the full carriage in the shot.', '2003-12-23 22:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(521377, 51072, 8891, '<td valign="top">Do not loike the DOF here, would have liked the subject entirely in focus. and I do not know what to tell you about the double reflections....I''ve gotten the doubles in my mirror shots as well and I think it comes from using more than one direction of light being used in lighting the subject.</td>', 'Do not loike the DOF here, would have liked the subject entirely in focus. and I do not know what to tell you about the double reflections....I''ve gotten the doubles in my mirror shots as well and I think it comes from using more than one direction of light being used in lighting the subject.', '2003-12-23 22:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(521379, 51156, 8891, '<td valign="top">The subject is the vehicle not the cute kid....the front of the little john deere is not in the frame....and BTW lose the frame....and the entire kid is. cute kid/ nice protrait.</td>', 'The subject is the vehicle not the cute kid....the front of the little john deere is not in the frame....and BTW lose the frame....and the entire kid is. cute kid/ nice protrait.', '2003-12-23 22:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(521394, 51088, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''ve never been to big on psychedelic looking shots and this one is no exception.<br/>TC</td>', 'I''ve never been to big on psychedelic looking shots and this one is no exception.TC', '2003-12-23 22:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(521395, 51179, 9906, '<td valign="top">Heesh I didn''t see it at first...<br/>TC</td>', 'Heesh I didn''t see it at first...TC', '2003-12-23 22:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(521396, 50951, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but this shot is overexposed and underexposed all at the same time.  You also don''t have the right white balance thus the yellow color.<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice composition, but this shot is overexposed and underexposed all at the same time.  You also don''t have the right white balance thus the yellow color.TC', '2003-12-23 22:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(521399, 51096, 9906, '<td valign="top">You need to play around witht he colors here.  Your skin tones are not quite right.  Love the blue of the water and the yellow oars though.<br/>TC</td>', 'You need to play around witht he colors here.  Your skin tones are not quite right.  Love the blue of the water and the yellow oars though.TC', '2003-12-23 22:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(521401, 50765, 9906, '<td valign="top">IN order for this shot to work for me you would have to move around so that you can''t see the bike tire itself.  Nice capture though!<br/>TC</td>', 'IN order for this shot to work for me you would have to move around so that you can''t see the bike tire itself.  Nice capture though!TC', '2003-12-23 22:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(521403, 51067, 9906, '<td valign="top">This shot is too small for my taste.  You are underexposed on the subject.  In order to get this shot right, you would have to be very fast and have a good working knowledge of your camera.<br/>TC</td>', 'This shot is too small for my taste.  You are underexposed on the subject.  In order to get this shot right, you would have to be very fast and have a good working knowledge of your camera.TC', '2003-12-23 22:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(521405, 51063, 9906, '<td valign="top">I can give lee way for feet in a vehicle challenge, or models in a vehicle challenge, but models of feet in a vehicle challenge don''t work for me.  Your shot is not exposed really well either.  The right foot is underexposed, and the background behind the left foot is blown out...<br/>TC</td>', 'I can give lee way for feet in a vehicle challenge, or models in a vehicle challenge, but models of feet in a vehicle challenge don''t work for me.  Your shot is not exposed really well either.  The right foot is underexposed, and the background behind the left foot is blown out...TC', '2003-12-23 22:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(521410, 50947, 9906, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this shot is very harsh.  This leads me to believe that you used the on camera flash.  This results in the overexposed appearance of the feet and the harsh shadows behind.  If you''re gonna use flash at this short a distance, try taping toilet paper or light thin cloth over the flash...  Your composition is not bad, with some more creative lighting (no flash, light from side, use tripod to hold camera very still) and this could be an interesting study.<br/>TC</td>', 'The lighting on this shot is very harsh.  This leads me to believe that you used the on camera flash.  This results in the overexposed appearance of the feet and the harsh shadows behind.  If you''re gonna use flash at this short a distance, try taping toilet paper or light thin cloth over the flash...  Your composition is not bad, with some more creative lighting (no flash, light from side, use tripod to hold camera very still) and this could be an interesting study.TC', '2003-12-23 22:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(521416, 50697, 9906, '<td valign="top">From the overall look of the shot, I would have to say that you overexposed on purpose.  This isn''t a style that I quite care for though.  The girls face looks especially blown out.<br/>TC</td>', 'From the overall look of the shot, I would have to say that you overexposed on purpose.  This isn''t a style that I quite care for though.  The girls face looks especially blown out.TC', '2003-12-23 22:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(521422, 51145, 9906, '<td valign="top">My first thought on this shot is that it''s WAY to busy.  You have MANY MANY unnecesary elements.  If you could drop a cloth or something behind the girls and bike, you would improve this shot by leaps and bounds.  The lighting on the girls is a little harsh and uneven.  The front girl is overexposed in hand and face back girl looks good!<br/>TC</td>', 'My first thought on this shot is that it''s WAY to busy.  You have MANY MANY unnecesary elements.  If you could drop a cloth or something behind the girls and bike, you would improve this shot by leaps and bounds.  The lighting on the girls is a little harsh and uneven.  The front girl is overexposed in hand and face back girl looks good!TC', '2003-12-23 23:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(521438, 50982, 13610, '<td valign="top">Vehicles doesn''t seem to be the subject here but but look more like a disturbing object in a potential print (4)</td>', 'Vehicles doesn''t seem to be the subject here but but look more like a disturbing object in a potential print (4)', '2003-12-23 23:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(521442, 51058, 13610, '<td valign="top">I like it, the bicycle doesn''t seem  to be the clear subject to my eyes but i like the photo (6)</td>', 'I like it, the bicycle doesn''t seem  to be the clear subject to my eyes but i like the photo (6)', '2003-12-23 23:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(521448, 50961, 13610, '<td valign="top">Look like the Norfolk harbor to me, good picture (6)</td>', 'Look like the Norfolk harbor to me, good picture (6)', '2003-12-23 23:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(521450, 51021, 13610, '<td valign="top">Great idea to shoot the shadow fo a vehicle instead of the vehicle (7)</td>', 'Great idea to shoot the shadow fo a vehicle instead of the vehicle (7)', '2003-12-23 23:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(521452, 51086, 13610, '<td valign="top">The photo is great but the composition make the bench more the clear subject to me. Maybe choosin another angle or place or  take a close up shot with a blurry background would have worked better for the challenge but of-the-theme a great pic. (6)</td>', 'The photo is great but the composition make the bench more the clear subject to me. Maybe choosin another angle or place or  take a close up shot with a blurry background would have worked better for the challenge but of-the-theme a great pic. (6)', '2003-12-23 23:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
