(521463, 51035, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and choice of B/W here.  It''s a little noisy, but that works well here IMHO.  It does look a little crooked, but that just may be the perspective.  The only thing I might have tried different was shooting from a lower angle to get a different feel...<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nice composition and choice of B/W here.  It''s a little noisy, but that works well here IMHO.  It does look a little crooked, but that just may be the perspective.  The only thing I might have tried different was shooting from a lower angle to get a different feel...TC', '2003-12-23 23:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
