(521768, 51039, 12160, '<td valign="top">Thank you all wonderful people for voting and leaving comments. I''m excited about this win, had fun doing and I myself is really happy with the way the photo turned out. All your comments/suggestions are all helpful and will keep them all in mind when working on a new project.<br/> <br/>Thanks again one and all. and happy holidays.! <br/> <br/>Congratulations to all other big winners and their great work. They all deserve a pat on the back or two.<br/> <br/>I''m looking forward to seeing more high quality photos. <br/></td>', 'Thank you all wonderful people for voting and leaving comments. I''m excited about this win, had fun doing and I myself is really happy with the way the photo turned out. All your comments/suggestions are all helpful and will keep them all in mind when working on a new project. Thanks again one and all. and happy holidays.!  Congratulations to all other big winners and their great work. They all deserve a pat on the back or two. I''m looking forward to seeing more high quality photos. ', '2003-12-24 04:10:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(521782, 51041, 8898, '<td valign="top">hahahhaha thanks you guys....I thought this might be a little iffy, but it IS a vehicle; water is being transported...among other things;) Not in this shot though I promise it was a clean bowl.<br/>But thanks so much for those of you who liked the picture! I am kind of new at this, but I think I am going to try and enter more.<br/>I must say I do feel a little validated that a few people "got" what i was doing.<br/>Thanks for all your comments,<br/>Jen.</td>', 'hahahhaha thanks you guys....I thought this might be a little iffy, but it IS a vehicle; water is being transported...among other things;) Not in this shot though I promise it was a clean bowl.But thanks so much for those of you who liked the picture! I am kind of new at this, but I think I am going to try and enter more.I must say I do feel a little validated that a few people "got" what i was doing.Thanks for all your comments,Jen.', '2003-12-24 04:59:16.000000', NULL, 0),
