(522043, 50622, 10785, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by EL-ROI:</b></div><hr/><i>Before the challenge ends, I just want to record that I believe this is a photo by Pitsaman.<br/> <br/>(Sorry if I''m wrong, but I just thought I might be able to pick his style of photography from a crowd.)</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>haha! What an eye! Great shot Pitsaman and a nice finish. I would have liked to see this rated at least a top ten, even a ribbon winner!</td>', 'Originally posted by EL-ROI:Before the challenge ends, I just want to record that I believe this is a photo by Pitsaman. (Sorry if I''m wrong, but I just thought I might be able to pick his style of photography from a crowd.)  haha! What an eye! Great shot Pitsaman and a nice finish. I would have liked to see this rated at least a top ten, even a ribbon winner!', '2003-12-24 10:01:31.000000', NULL, 0),
