(522420, 50882, 1135, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your first ribbon, score another one for the AZ team! <br/> <br/>Where was this shot taken? Ive always wanted to try flying one of those things.<br/> <br/>Im looking forward to the Jan get together. Just let me now where and when. <br/> <br/>P.S. Dont let Steve know that Im coming, Im afraid of what he may do.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-12-24 15:34:50.</i></td>', 'Congratulations on your first ribbon, score another one for the AZ team!  Where was this shot taken? Ive always wanted to try flying one of those things. Im looking forward to the Jan get together. Just let me now where and when.  P.S. Dont let Steve know that Im coming, Im afraid of what he may do.', '2003-12-24 15:34:13.000000', '2003-12-24 15:34:50.000000', 0),
(522433, 50882, 8125, '<td valign="top">Thank you everyone for the wonderful comments!  I was pretty darn surprised to open my browser and find this shot in 3rd place!  Makes for a nice little Christmas gift.  :-)<br/> <br/>I was out shooting a friend of ours at a Motocross track in the East Valley.  He''d just come off the track for a break, so I set my camera down for a break also.  I started hearing comments "look, check that out".  Turned around and there they were.  Made a quick reach for the camera and didn''t have much time for focusing, set up, etc. they were passing us by.  The first couple shots I took didn''t have the moon in it.  The last one I saw the moon in the viewfinder and remember thinking: I hope this turns out.  <br/> <br/>That''s how I got this one and now I''ll be heading out to try and 1) find this guy and 2) get more shots of them.</td>', 'Thank you everyone for the wonderful comments!  I was pretty darn surprised to open my browser and find this shot in 3rd place!  Makes for a nice little Christmas gift.  :-) I was out shooting a friend of ours at a Motocross track in the East Valley.  He''d just come off the track for a break, so I set my camera down for a break also.  I started hearing comments "look, check that out".  Turned around and there they were.  Made a quick reach for the camera and didn''t have much time for focusing, set up, etc. they were passing us by.  The first couple shots I took didn''t have the moon in it.  The last one I saw the moon in the viewfinder and remember thinking: I hope this turns out.   That''s how I got this one and now I''ll be heading out to try and 1) find this guy and 2) get more shots of them.', '2003-12-24 15:46:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(522469, 50390, 13403, '<td valign="top">what bothers me most about this picture is that its my second highest rated... i don''t really care for it as much as all that..  i thought it was humorous and all, but now i have to take 3 pictures with a higher rating to get the thumbnail out of my profile..   i goofed on the spelling in the title..  its all very embarrassing for me.</td>', 'what bothers me most about this picture is that its my second highest rated... i don''t really care for it as much as all that..  i thought it was humorous and all, but now i have to take 3 pictures with a higher rating to get the thumbnail out of my profile..   i goofed on the spelling in the title..  its all very embarrassing for me.', '2003-12-24 16:44:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(522482, 50379, 9949, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone!<br/> <br/>My intention with this picture was to show the activity that goes on when a cargo plane is being loaded. Thats why I wanted a moving vehicle in the picture. Now i know that noone likes the moving lights, so I guess I have learned something from this.<br/> <br/>I am very happy about the ribbon, it was the best christmas present. An extra big thank you to all of you who have taken time to write comments.<br/> <br/>God Jul och Gott nytt år!<br/> <br/>Henrik</td>', 'Thanks everyone! My intention with this picture was to show the activity that goes on when a cargo plane is being loaded. Thats why I wanted a moving vehicle in the picture. Now i know that noone likes the moving lights, so I guess I have learned something from this. I am very happy about the ribbon, it was the best christmas present. An extra big thank you to all of you who have taken time to write comments. God Jul och Gott nytt år! Henrik', '2003-12-24 16:53:15.000000', NULL, 0),
