(523107, 51054, 10084, '<td valign="top">I gave you a "7" on this shot. I believe that the framing overwhelms the entire composition. The composition is interesting and fairly nice to look at but the borders seem to take over the shot. <br/> <br/>The sweeping angle of the handlebars is something I really like in the shot. It makes your eyes look from the top of the shot toward the bottom. <br/> <br/>The lighting at the event like most events are not the most disirable. A little more contrast on the girl would really help to make her pop out of the shot. Seems quite dark at the moment.<br/> <br/>The blueish light helps to give something to focus in on in the shot and looks really nice.</td>', 'I gave you a "7" on this shot. I believe that the framing overwhelms the entire composition. The composition is interesting and fairly nice to look at but the borders seem to take over the shot.  The sweeping angle of the handlebars is something I really like in the shot. It makes your eyes look from the top of the shot toward the bottom.  The lighting at the event like most events are not the most disirable. A little more contrast on the girl would really help to make her pop out of the shot. Seems quite dark at the moment. The blueish light helps to give something to focus in on in the shot and looks really nice.', '2003-12-26 01:13:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(523146, 51201, 11078, '<td valign="top">Hi Micheal<br/> <br/>I hate guns and what they represent <br/>But I do have to agree with you. Man is the vehicle and the gun the tool<br/>The image is very sharp and crisp and well positioned <br/>So I dont think you derserve such a bad score and it does fit the challenge I did not vote on this challenge (too busy) <br/>but seeing your image I just had to let you know that while the topic is not pleasing. The photo itself is excellent in my opinion and should have beaten a lot of the shots taken in this challenge <br/>Try and leave the gun out next time.<br/>Regards<br/>Sally</td>', 'Hi Micheal I hate guns and what they represent But I do have to agree with you. Man is the vehicle and the gun the toolThe image is very sharp and crisp and well positioned So I dont think you derserve such a bad score and it does fit the challenge I did not vote on this challenge (too busy) but seeing your image I just had to let you know that while the topic is not pleasing. The photo itself is excellent in my opinion and should have beaten a lot of the shots taken in this challenge Try and leave the gun out next time.RegardsSally', '2003-12-26 03:48:49.000000', NULL, 0),
