(525704, 50596, 6624, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club:<br/>What fun to capture the old one all decked out.  There is just enough of the Model T showing to pull this off, although it would have been nice if you could have brought it out a bit more.  The lights are erratic and emphasize the motion of the car, as does the lighting over the wheels.  The sepia tones are very soft and and serve to hold the decorative lights in importance.  Overall this is a grab it while you can image and as such is very pleasant.  Thanks for it.</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club:What fun to capture the old one all decked out.  There is just enough of the Model T showing to pull this off, although it would have been nice if you could have brought it out a bit more.  The lights are erratic and emphasize the motion of the car, as does the lighting over the wheels.  The sepia tones are very soft and and serve to hold the decorative lights in importance.  Overall this is a grab it while you can image and as such is very pleasant.  Thanks for it.', '2003-12-29 17:24:33.000000', NULL, 0),
