(622354, 50882, 16780, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  I just became a full fledged member &amp; was just browsing the archives.  If you would all like to know, this is called a "PPC" or Powered Parachute.  Kind of a combination of a go cart with a big fan on teh back &amp; parachute over head.  I know many pilots &amp; work some of the air shows they have.  If any Photographers are in the IL area (45 minutes outside of St Louis) in mid august, you can catch the Powered Parachute World Chanpionship Competition.  Details can be found at <a href="//www.chute-out.com" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.chute-out.com</a>   This will be my 4th yr there working a booth.  VERY cool thing to watch, photograph &amp; do, but intro flights aren''t available at competitions.  I have hundreds of shots of them.  Here''s one of an Australian pilot (love their accents!)<br/> <br/><a href="//lighthousetshirtsplus.com/images/TheAussies.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//lighthousetshirtsplus.com/images/TheAussies.jpg'', strrpos(''//lighthousetshirtsplus.com/images/TheAussies.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//lighthousetshirtsplus.com/images/TheAussies.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Nancy<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-03-15 14:32:36.</i></td>', 'Great shot!  I just became a full fledged member & was just browsing the archives.  If you would all like to know, this is called a "PPC" or Powered Parachute.  Kind of a combination of a go cart with a big fan on teh back & parachute over head.  I know many pilots & work some of the air shows they have.  If any Photographers are in the IL area (45 minutes outside of St Louis) in mid august, you can catch the Powered Parachute World Chanpionship Competition.  Details can be found at //www.chute-out.com   This will be my 4th yr there working a booth.  VERY cool thing to watch, photograph & do, but intro flights aren''t available at competitions.  I have hundreds of shots of them.  Here''s one of an Australian pilot (love their accents!)   Nancy', '2004-03-15 14:28:17.000000', '2004-03-15 14:32:36.000000', 0),
