(1121381, 50885, 27489, '<td valign="top">If you look very closely you can see that this is in color. The dash from the closest vehicle has a hue of yellow in it from a street light... ;o)</td>', 'If you look very closely you can see that this is in color. The dash from the closest vehicle has a hue of yellow in it from a street light... ;o)', '2005-01-20 12:56:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(1140541, 51074, 9581, '<td valign="top">I look at this and think I  about what I have seen in the news....<br/>The tugboat that the current washed away...<br/>Its a sad thing that peoples lives were lost and I hope that their families are ok...<br/>People have tragic losses all the time and the only thing we can do as photographers, friends, citizens, or what any person can do  is to keep positive and hope with in us. Keep at this  creating these beautifull images of what you see in your daily life. You never know when someone will need an image to perk them up for what ever reason may be. This picture helps me it has a feeling of safety to it. The colors are awesome!</td>', 'I look at this and think I  about what I have seen in the news....The tugboat that the current washed away...Its a sad thing that peoples lives were lost and I hope that their families are ok...People have tragic losses all the time and the only thing we can do as photographers, friends, citizens, or what any person can do  is to keep positive and hope with in us. Keep at this  creating these beautifull images of what you see in your daily life. You never know when someone will need an image to perk them up for what ever reason may be. This picture helps me it has a feeling of safety to it. The colors are awesome!', '2005-01-30 18:02:02.000000', NULL, 0),
